  PROT_READ | PROT_WRITE,
  MAP_PRIVATE, fd, 0);
/* Private write creates COW backing. */
p[0] = 'X';
```

What is the first byte of `cfg.bin` on disk afterwards? Assume standard headers, successful open/mmap, a nonempty file, and no other writer.
